---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Miranda · UX & Product Consultant for complex software"
  description="I design complex digital products, workflows and decision systems. I work between business, users and development teams to turn operational complexity into software people can actually use."
  page="home-en"
  bg='data-max="140" data-link="155" data-accent="0.10" data-speed="0.15" data-parallax="30"'
  immersiveHero
>
  <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
  <section class="imm">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="imm-grid">

        <div class="imm-copy">
          <div class="eyebrow-live">
            <span class="eyebrow no-rule">UX &amp; Product Consultant</span>
            <span class="status-chip"><span class="led"></span> <span id="heroStatus">triage session</span></span>
          </div>
          <h1>
            <span class="ln l1"><span>I design complex</span></span>
            <span class="ln l2"><span>digital products,</span></span>
            <span class="ln l3"><span><span class="accent-draw">workflows and decisions.</span></span></span>
          </h1>
          <p class="lede fade-up f1">I work between business, users and development teams to turn operational complexity into software people can actually use. Before buying, rebuilding or building from scratch, let's understand what actually needs to change.</p>
          <div class="cta-row fade-up f2">
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg magnetic" href="https://calendly.com/mirandauxdesigner/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i data-lucide="calendar-check" class="ic"></i> Book a triage call</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg magnetic" href="/en/services">See the services</a>
          </div>
          <div class="proof-im fade-up f3">
            <span><b>2 weeks</b> time-boxed</span>
            <span class="sep">·</span>
            <span><b>€1,500</b> fixed price</span>
            <span class="sep">·</span>
            <span>adoption roadmap included</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="console-wrap">
          <div class="chip-float c1" data-depth="1.5"><i data-lucide="route" class="ic"></i><span><b>Process mapping</b><small>as-is → to-be</small></span></div>
          <div class="chip-float c2" data-depth="2.1"><i data-lucide="shield-check" class="ic"></i><span><b>Risk managed</b><small>before signing</small></span></div>
          <div class="console-im" id="heroConsole">
            <div class="holo glow-wine scanlines">
              <div class="c-head">
                <div class="lights"><i class="l1" style="background:#7c223f"></i><i class="l2" style="background:#b7791f"></i><i class="l3" style="background:#2e855a"></i></div>
                <div class="c-title"><span id="heroCtitle">Decision console</span><span class="caret">▌</span></div>
                <div class="c-ref"><span class="timer" id="heroTimer">00:00</span><span class="live"><span class="led"></span> live</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="c-body">
                <div class="pipe">
                  <span class="node n1"><i data-lucide="route" class="ic"></i> Process</span>
                  <span class="wire w1"></span>
                  <span class="node n2"><i data-lucide="box" class="ic"></i> Software</span>
                  <span class="wire w2"></span>
                  <span class="node n3"><i data-lucide="users-round" class="ic"></i> Adoption</span>
                  <span class="wire w3"></span>
                  <span class="node n4"><i data-lucide="clipboard-check" class="ic"></i> QA</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mtx-head">
                  <span class="lbl">Decision matrix · extract</span>
                  <span class="mtx-tabs">
                    <button data-tool="A" class="on">Highlight A</button>
                    <button data-tool="B">Highlight B</button>
                  </span>
                </div>
                <div class="mtx-shell">
                  <div class="scanbeam"><span class="edge"></span></div>
                  <table class="mtx">
                    <thead><tr><th>Criterion</th><th data-col="A" class="win">Tool A</th><th data-col="B">Tool B</th><th>Risk</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                      <tr><td class="crit">Operational team adoption</td><td data-col="A" class="win"><span class="tag-ok">High</span></td><td data-col="B"><span class="tag-mid">Medium</span></td><td>Curve B</td></tr>
                      <tr><td class="crit">24-month cost</td><td data-col="A" class="win"><span class="tag-mid">€42k</span></td><td data-col="B"><span class="tag-ok">€31k</span></td><td>Custom B</td></tr>
                      <tr><td class="crit">ERP integration</td><td data-col="A" class="win"><span class="tag-ok">Native</span></td><td data-col="B"><span class="tag-no">External</span></td><td>Middleware</td></tr>
                      <tr><td class="crit">Time to steady state</td><td data-col="A" class="win"><span class="tag-ok">6 wks</span></td><td data-col="B"><span class="tag-mid">10 wks</span></td><td>Training</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                  </table>
                </div>
                <div class="verdict" id="verdict">
                  <span class="seal"><i data-lucide="check"></i></span>
                  <span class="vtext"><b>Decision: Tool A</b><span>Defensible against real processes, not the demo.</span></span>
                  <span class="vmeta">3 criteria · 1 risk<br>managed</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cue"><span class="mouse"></span>Scroll</div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ PILLARS ============ -->
  <section class="section tight">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow">What I hold together</div>
        <h2 class="h2-cinema">Four things that decide whether software becomes an asset or a cost.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="offers grid-4cols" style="margin-top:36px;">
        <div class="card-d reveal d1"><div class="ic-badge"><i data-lucide="route"></i></div><h3 style="font-size:19px">Process</h3><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;margin-top:8px">I map how you work today, where the flow breaks, where a tool helps and where it doesn't.</p></div>
        <div class="card-d reveal d2"><div class="ic-badge"><i data-lucide="box"></i></div><h3 style="font-size:19px">Software</h3><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;margin-top:8px">Selection starts from real processes, not vendor demos. The process is everything, the software is just a tool.</p></div>
        <div class="card-d reveal d3"><div class="ic-badge"><i data-lucide="users-round"></i></div><h3 style="font-size:19px">Adoption</h3><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;margin-top:8px">A tool that nobody uses is just a cost. Adoption is designed, not assumed.</p></div>
        <div class="card-d reveal d4"><div class="ic-badge"><i data-lucide="clipboard-check"></i></div><h3 style="font-size:19px">UX Quality</h3><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;margin-top:8px">UX QA, accessibility, microcopy. Software doesn't just need to work, it needs to be used.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ PROBLEM ============ -->
  <section class="section section-light soft">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="lead-2col">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="eyebrow">The real problem</div>
          <h2 class="h2-cinema" style="margin-top:14px;">The cost of getting digital wrong isn't how much you spend to launch it, it's how much you lose when nobody uses it.</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="reveal d1" style="font-size:17px;line-height:27px;">A system chosen from a demo. A site that's recent but already misaligned. A feature no one touches. Tickets that come back the same every week. The team falling back to spreadsheets. Often the problem isn't the tool — it's the decision made without looking at the actual process.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="offers grid-3cols" style="margin-top:40px;">
        <div class="reveal d1" style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--color-ink-200);border-radius:20px;padding:24px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)">
          <div style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:800;color:var(--accent-wine);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase">Before</div>
          <p style="color:var(--color-ink-700);margin-top:10px;font-size:15px;line-height:23px">"Let's go with this one, it looked great in the demo."</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal d2" style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--color-ink-200);border-radius:20px;padding:24px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)">
          <div style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:800;color:var(--color-warning);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase">6 months later</div>
          <p style="color:var(--color-ink-700);margin-top:10px;font-size:15px;line-height:23px">"Three people use it, everyone else went back to shared files."</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal d3" style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--color-ink-200);border-radius:20px;padding:24px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)">
          <div style="font-family:var(--font-heading);font-weight:800;color:var(--color-system-blue-600);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase">With a triage</div>
          <p style="color:var(--color-ink-700);margin-top:10px;font-size:15px;line-height:23px">"We knew what we needed and what to defer, before signing."</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ OFFERS ============ -->
  <section class="section" id="services">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow">Services</div>
        <h2 class="h2-cinema">Fixed timelines, declared outputs, explicit anti-scope.</h2>
        <p>No endless retainers, no guaranteed upsells. Each service says what it includes and what it doesn't.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="offers">
        <a class="offer feat reveal d1" href="/software-fit-sprint">
          <span class="flag">Core</span>
          <div class="tier">Decision sprint</div>
          <h3>Software Fit Sprint</h3>
          <p>Select, validate or discard a software decision starting from real processes, not vendor demos. Process map, weighted criteria, shortlist, decision matrix, adoption roadmap.</p>
          <div class="price"><b>€1,500</b><span>fixed · 2 weeks</span></div>
          <span class="arrow">Book a triage call <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></span>
        </a>
        <a class="offer reveal d2" href="/website-evolution">
          <div class="tier">Entry</div>
          <h3>Website Evolution &amp; Adoption Check</h3>
          <p>Is a recent site still supporting the business? UX audit, gap analysis and a 3-6 month roadmap without rebuilding everything.</p>
          <div class="price"><b>€1,200</b><span>fixed · 1 week</span></div>
          <span class="arrow">Send the link + objective <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></span>
        </a>
        <a class="offer reveal d3" href="/qa">
          <div class="tier">Recurring</div>
          <h3>UX/UI QA &amp; Functional Testing</h3>
          <p>I test real flows and edge cases before releases, so fewer experience bugs reach production.</p>
          <div class="price"><b>€800</b><span>/ month · 3-6 months</span></div>
          <span class="arrow">Start a pilot month <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></span>
        </a>
        <a class="offer reveal d4" href="/software-su-misura">
          <div class="tier">Design</div>
          <h3>Custom software design</h3>
          <p>Turn complex processes into software designed on real workflows, with clear requirements and acceptance criteria, before writing code.</p>
          <div class="price"><b>Quoted</b><span>after triage call</span></div>
          <span class="arrow">See the service <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i></span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="row reveal" style="margin-top:24px;justify-content:center;">
        <a class="btn btn-secondary magnetic" href="/en/services">All services <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="ic"></i></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ PARTNER band ============ -->
  <section class="section tight">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="holo glow-blue reveal" style="padding:48px;">
        <div class="lead-2col" style="align-items:center;">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">Dev partner</div>
            <h2 class="h2-cinema" style="margin-top:14px;max-width:16ch;">I handle the decision, the UX and the QA. You handle the delivery.</h2>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:25px;">I work closely with developers and agencies. Clear roles, less rework, cleaner handoff and more client confidence. You build, I hold the quality of the decision and the experience.</p>
            <div class="cta-row" style="margin-top:24px;">
              <a class="btn btn-primary magnetic" href="/partner"><i data-lucide="handshake" class="ic"></i> Propose a partnership</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ CTA ============ -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="cta-band reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow center" style="justify-content:center;">Next step</div>
        <h2 style="margin-top:14px;">A 30-minute triage call.</h2>
        <p>If you're working on a complex digital product, workflow or internal system, tell me what isn't working. If it's a good fit, I'll outline how we can work together. If it isn't, I'll tell you why and point you in the right direction.</p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg magnetic" href="https://calendly.com/mirandauxdesigner/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i data-lucide="calendar-check" class="ic"></i> Book a triage call</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
